        "like": 1
      },
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Yes please! I would very much like to have this. Preferably having actual exception handing would be best. Udon gives the ability to make very complex game logic within worlds now. Having the tools to make sure it doesn't break easily will allow the best experiences for players.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
    {
