      "internal": false,
      "mergeID": "67410450b176c27710dfd974",
      "mergedPostDetails": "Current error and exception in the console only shows that something happened, but doesn't really tell you where or with what node it happened with.\n\nWould be nice if we could get more information so it's easier to find bugs that are either user errors or from the game.",
