  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2020-07-01T16:08:35.625Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "If an exception is thrown by a call made by a Udon program, the instigating event should be terminated with a clean error message, rather than permanently crashing the entire behaviour.\nIn addition, an OnException(error) event which contains the exception object thrown for handling when things explode would be extremely handy.",
